      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T13:46:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "afaict all the accessors from SkImage_Picture are only used in the Graphite and Ganesh generate_picture_texture helper(s). It seems like it would be better to add a replay() method to SkImage_Picture (which takes a lock and does the drawPicture call) and hide the accessors. This does have the issue that we would want to make SkImage_Picture::props be thread-safe so it could be called to create the SkSurface passed into the replay() call.",
      "parentUuid": "4571d4f6_f907d8af",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 103,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 103,
