      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T13:57:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah that would be a good simplification. If we were to do that, another way of making this function independent of the rest of the SkTiledImageUtils key is that it could return just 4 ints, since the bit-packed properties, the picture ID, and translation are the only values that have to be returned while the lock is held. The image\u0027s width and height can be trivially added in the tile code, and it can handle storing the lazy-picture key values in the overall key array where it makes sense.",
